# google-services.json is intentionally committed (not gitignored): this is a
# private repo, and the file itself isn't a true secret per Google's own
# guidance — real access control is enforced by Firestore Security Rules,
# not by keeping this file out of version control. It's needed here so
# GitHub Actions CI (a fresh checkout on every run) can build the app.
